cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Validating machine-learned hydrogen adsorption energies against DFT"
abstract: >-
  Code and data for a validation study of AdsorbML/UMA machine-learning
  predictions of the hydrogen adsorption free energy against GPAW DFT
  calculations, across seven families of Mo-based HER catalyst materials.
  265 candidate structures were screened with the ML model and 83 were
  recomputed with DFT using a balanced factorial validation design.
